        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K537S-MKZ, MacKenzie Lever with Quaker Interior Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA stunning traditional leverset, the MacKenzie Lever with Small Quaker Plate is perfect for your home. It is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The MacKenzie Lever with Quaker Interior Plate will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is available in a wide array of beautiful finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/quaker-solid-brass-latchset-brass-accents-d07-k539\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D07-K537S-MKZ Interior Quaker Plate with MacKenzie Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
