                "title": "MacKenzie Lever with Small Quaker Plate",
                "description": "A stunning traditional leverset, the MacKenzie Lever with Small Quaker Plate is perfect for your home. It is available in dummy, passage, or privacy functions. The MacKenzie Lever with Quaker Interior Plate will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is available in a wide array of beautiful finish colors.",
